{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>韓國人氣女團TWICE成員彩瑛，近日因一段在網路瘋傳的影片意外捲入抽煙風波。網路上曝光的影片，是她日前出席一場派對的畫面，在昏暗的影片中，彩瑛將拿在手中的物品移向嘴邊，沒想到這幕瞬間被部分網友放大檢視，質疑她「室內吸煙」違法了。</p><p>眼見風波越演越烈，彩瑛8月12日選擇不再沉默，透過粉絲互動平台正面回應此事。她無奈表示，原本想選擇冷處理、不予理會，但私訊與留言不斷被相關話題灌爆，讓她不得不親自出面說清楚。</p><figure><img alt=\"彩瑛（Instagram@chaeyo.0）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251121/1068580775307513856352860.jpeg/7mJJaLlfG3169Ps1l1JTHO0VogTI5I0Insz-hZ7M_oU\"/><figcaption>彩瑛（Instagram@chaeyo.0）</figcaption></figure><p>TWICE彩瑛派對喝飲料卻被傳室內吸煙　無奈嘆「沒那麼沒大腦」：</p><figure><img alt=\"韓國人氣女團TWICE成員彩瑛，近日因一段在網路瘋傳的影片意外捲入抽煙風波。（X＠godmitzu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260814/1164880740425404416928643.png/qn3k6Ri6hiFAZ-h0BuMQpc3Qt4du4c7-CFoXOwhaFzs\"/><figcaption>韓國人氣女團TWICE成員彩瑛，近日因一段在網路瘋傳的影片意外捲入抽煙風波。（X＠godmitzu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"韓國人氣女團TWICE成員彩瑛，近日因一段在網路瘋傳的影片意外捲入抽煙風波。（X＠godmitzu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260814/1164880742744985600160784.png/m5FNKGrMwTjogwGt9zLk58NUUNu-CT4Y5hP6NeYT-jU\"/><figcaption>韓國人氣女團TWICE成員彩瑛，近日因一段在網路瘋傳的影片意外捲入抽煙風波。（X＠godmitzu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"韓國人氣女團TWICE成員彩瑛，近日因一段在網路瘋傳的影片意外捲入抽煙風波。（X＠godmitzu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260814/1164880745001652224013968.png/OmabZy1BoZ98k0NcLvUXP-hoP9nXmoVB0z7gAtM-4AI\"/><figcaption>韓國人氣女團TWICE成員彩瑛，近日因一段在網路瘋傳的影片意外捲入抽煙風波。（X＠godmitzu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"韓國人氣女團TWICE成員彩瑛，近日因一段在網路瘋傳的影片意外捲入抽煙風波。（X＠godmitzu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260814/1164880747300261888439560.png/spaHSJsF9AcBZNBOpMJlTaD3TCpyu-ZXEK4NwBCuDcA\"/><figcaption>韓國人氣女團TWICE成員彩瑛，近日因一段在網路瘋傳的影片意外捲入抽煙風波。（X＠godmitzu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"彩瑛（Instagram@chaeyo.0）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251121/1068580782417121280618245.jpeg/9Y1KOYuCtpTR-6xduVOFfTvXWI4wQTnaa5KvI2uSryM\"/><figcaption>彩瑛（Instagram@chaeyo.0）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"彩瑛（Instagram@chaeyo.0）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251121/1068580778604498944491357.jpeg/v3jkbGtK3C2jmj67x9TSpVTSiMq53p0AJxNhSCcTYUg\"/><figcaption>彩瑛（Instagram@chaeyo.0）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"彩瑛（Instagram@chaeyo.0）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251121/1068580778541453312615704.jpeg/9uijWI5uQh-HaxK6yVQ5U04HRTc5RUXDyc4eAcnOHgE\"/><figcaption>彩瑛（Instagram@chaeyo.0）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"彩瑛（Instagram@chaeyo.0）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251121/1068580779858595840075284.jpeg/NUSXETMUxclSY6DIviI0Ha21HtCQkK56mryiIZq8oiE\"/><figcaption>彩瑛（Instagram@chaeyo.0）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"彩瑛（Instagram@chaeyo.0）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251121/1068580780361781248827916.jpeg/u0DexoM1yghW7smNAgaHOGDkGXZqGRK-PGjCCDxowgg\"/><figcaption>彩瑛（Instagram@chaeyo.0）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"彩瑛（Instagram@chaeyo.0）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251121/1068580781070749696240398.jpeg/3wbBFVJGB_qg6pPQkBHansaruFLkpgkiDCfU2wwn1Ns\"/><figcaption>彩瑛（Instagram@chaeyo.0）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"彩瑛（Instagram@chaeyo.0）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251121/1068580774149885952952087.jpeg/GeLKBMguhd5fhj8jjabHvqhqJCH7emnNmr0i45q9IuM\"/><figcaption>彩瑛（Instagram@chaeyo.0）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"彩瑛（Instagram@chaeyo.0）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251121/1068580775139610624594163.jpeg/ikeIamHlSsg9NHtMz8IKPMnlbFO1AjYL9JtsffSbbH0\"/><figcaption>彩瑛（Instagram@chaeyo.0）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"彩瑛（Instagram@chaeyo.0）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251121/1068580775550783488917542.jpeg/LCZDjBw69ZoneC7xlqTMdomaj8ge-HwAqEr_AqhK_wI\"/><figcaption>彩瑛（Instagram@chaeyo.0）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"彩瑛（Instagram@chaeyo.0）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251121/1068580776289112064908427.jpeg/s1J_W_vSHfqtT2UuzwYJYAKNARiEfeXwPVH9TD1R_Uw\"/><figcaption>彩瑛（Instagram@chaeyo.0）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"彩瑛（Instagram@chaeyo.0）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251121/1068580777564180480702541.jpeg/K1TvTsZhovOE6LyjDXjAKyM7p9iqZPgQ4_7IXeP-yF0\"/><figcaption>彩瑛（Instagram@chaeyo.0）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"彩瑛（Instagram@chaeyo.0）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251121/1068580777568243712491087.jpeg/yr5d7DwdimYyzeCuJYE8OhfwbqpSu52p1mFT-tZhU_o\"/><figcaption>彩瑛（Instagram@chaeyo.0）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"彩瑛（Instagram@chaeyo.0）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251121/1068580770232143872786205.jpeg/1KroE-3h1UluJLT8D-DDsLkiNai8JQU0QOt3Q0Drd0M\"/><figcaption>彩瑛（Instagram@chaeyo.0）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"彩瑛（Instagram@chaeyo.0）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251121/1068580770467024896628094.jpeg/ZAmsf9Vv_mOUubcji_PMhdn6U56e28vLfR8D230fA9s\"/><figcaption>彩瑛（Instagram@chaeyo.0）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"彩瑛（Instagram@chaeyo.0）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251121/1068580771209547776215387.jpeg/JqaoPUBZG8IRkelIlc6WumMjFb0x03_lHanaHR2p2h0\"/><figcaption>彩瑛（Instagram@chaeyo.0）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"彩瑛（Instagram@chaeyo.0）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251121/1068580773545906176490758.jpeg/6ERljNIKlP6rUr6d5-DOXo4YGLirJ_Zv1_9Phdf_T4U\"/><figcaption>彩瑛（Instagram@chaeyo.0）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"彩瑛（Instagram@chaeyo.0）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251121/1068580771863859200421789.jpeg/cLph0rONW6YNIB8ldSITgI9Cdu3D0hIbsbwFy7G8Bcs\"/><figcaption>彩瑛（Instagram@chaeyo.0）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"彩瑛（Instagram@chaeyo.0）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251121/1068580772547399680275083.jpeg/lnmzze1gQYxtRill2oHuYBmb3oz8-PuI-PhLHfj4Sx0\"/><figcaption>彩瑛（Instagram@chaeyo.0）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"彩瑛（Instagram@chaeyo.0）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251121/1068580772702720000079461.jpeg/MoFplqMDNu1aSx0818k7x6nFsSKuCylurvh0La74dC0\"/><figcaption>彩瑛（Instagram@chaeyo.0）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"彩瑛（Instagram@chaeyo.0）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251121/1068580769519112192315629.jpeg/ygV5lDL6UqmrAQhns6_hxdhd4rC7geQiiGvzi4hr84s\"/><figcaption>彩瑛（Instagram@chaeyo.0）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"彩瑛（Instagram@chaeyo.0）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251121/1068580768646696960164809.jpeg/70DMfeouQlb2RWo0cbCPcgFIlGN-If2FfYVceX2FXHk\"/><figcaption>彩瑛（Instagram@chaeyo.0）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"彩瑛（Instagram@chaeyo.0）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251121/1068578996121243648793128.jpeg/TlwSXp90uu6n11QgbGDO18BJ0cUtPlcL1IyveNSMr3g\"/><figcaption>彩瑛（Instagram@chaeyo.0）</figcaption></figure><p>彩瑛澄清：「那根本不是香煙，我是在喝飲料！」要大家仔細看清楚。</p><p>無端遭受抹黑，讓她感到無奈又覺得十分荒謬。彩瑛直言現場聚集了那麼多賓客與攝影機，自己不可能做出這種毫無分寸的事，無奈直言：「我並不是那麼沒大腦人。」直接打臉不實指控。</p><p>此外，TWICE 面臨成員續約問題，繼定延宣布離開JYP，轉身投入姊姊孔升妍所在的經紀公司VARO娛樂後，彩瑛也於8月13日透過IG曬出手寫信，正式宣布結束與老東家JYP娛樂長達14年的合作關係。她在信中感性告白，表達對陪伴多年的JYP團隊與成員們的深厚感謝，並坦言「TWICE就是我的根」。</p><p>彩瑛表示，未來將以個人工作室「LIL FANTASY」之名繼續展翅高飛、探索音樂版圖。同時她也向全球ONCE（粉絲名）打下定心針，強調「TWICE的彩瑛」永遠不會變，團體活動仍將持續進行。</p><figure><img alt=\"【延伸閱讀：TWICE定延宣布離巢JYP　加盟Varo娛樂與親姐孔升妍、邊佑錫成同門】TWICE定延親筆信證實離開JYP，確定加盟Varo娛樂。（Instagram@jy_piece）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260810/1163485516448927744790465.jpeg/dsMn7LmoGPrm90xt6mtFZf7x2lyIq5nfiYZPE4mGTxM\"/><figcaption>【延伸閱讀：TWICE定延宣布離巢JYP　加盟Varo娛樂與親姐孔升妍、邊佑錫成同門】TWICE定延親筆信證實離開JYP，確定加盟Varo娛樂。（Instagram@jy_piece）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"TWICE定延親筆信證實離開JYP，確定加盟Varo娛樂。（Instagram@jy_piece）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260810/1163485296910667776625817.jpeg/VvHuta-2hlMnCnfKc0wePBd7wtR6BY-6R5z9cEec_XA\"/><figcaption>TWICE定延親筆信證實離開JYP，確定加盟Varo娛樂。（Instagram@jy_piece）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"孔升妍和定延是親姐妹。（IG@0seungyeon）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260624/1146493184755372032649325.jpeg/7wwmwwz13M42r9WIA8tTj1JEnkYSllFYZQ670GUOu9A\"/><figcaption>孔升妍和定延是親姐妹。（IG@0seungyeon）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"TWICE定延（IG@jy_piece）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260507/1129095723141435392934026.jpeg/_W1iKO2QrbNA5ohE8pjcVsVoq5p1TAr7ZZWrJ2WVqyc\"/><figcaption>TWICE定延（IG@jy_piece）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"TWICE定延曾因服藥副作用發胖。（IG@jy_piece）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260507/1129095725452627968176049.jpeg/wWbHsUeWINUW-hmTUvjqhmMtVgxC7IAJvIDOjLyAzow\"/><figcaption>TWICE定延曾因服藥副作用發胖。（IG@jy_piece）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"TWICE定延曾因服藥副作用發胖。（IG@jy_piece）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260507/1129095720809271296340651.jpeg/gOE3aXNg8CId3WBUAMTz4OIT2ujs8HCiTjuLUE47i1A\"/><figcaption>TWICE定延曾因服藥副作用發胖。（IG@jy_piece）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"TWICE定延近照（IG@jy_piece）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260507/1129095142347640832254073.jpeg/NAVqFe5Vfuh-BLjP0w6ameb5AEdjqSPAy92abMvdmmw\"/><figcaption>TWICE定延近照（IG@jy_piece）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"TWICE定延近照（IG@jy_piece）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260507/1129094707532664832158943.jpeg/Feg2gqTE_8vw0-CUck-PbjIERdb3x270ttC3drbQt3Y\"/><figcaption>TWICE定延近照（IG@jy_piece）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"TWICE定延近照（IG@jy_piece）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260507/1129094709873217536351097.jpeg/W9XrmZCKFYHHXBcUF09j21uftwj3AnJoMAK1QzACtUM\"/><figcaption>TWICE定延近照（IG@jy_piece）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"TWICE定延近照（IG@jy_piece）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260507/1129094704810430464798532.jpeg/HhG4hfZDLXxkxpx7N-ed9IFjIL84Y2o5RMqeC0TKngs\"/><figcaption>TWICE定延近照（IG@jy_piece）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"TWICE定延近照（IG@jy_piece）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260507/1129094028122787840275409.jpeg/ruNSx3byNm-Tgzs4AQRCupl2KThKzjr-lszvRJbM70Q\"/><figcaption>TWICE定延近照（IG@jy_piece）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"TWICE