定延（IG@jy_piece）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"TWICE定延（IG@jy_piece）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260507/1129094023013863424704269.jpeg/PUgcMuXOfLr2p9FTUxk3XLkYf9lZf9tbXO3OI1ztziM\"/><figcaption>TWICE定延（IG@jy_piece）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"TWICE定延（IG@jy_piece）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260507/1129094023064195072723841.jpeg/x8Gzt1AhHPZbiSzVab8hdreQxxdw9suCPH_aJjx_2iY\"/><figcaption>TWICE定延（IG@jy_piece）</figcaption></figure><p>Haru曾拒當HYBE練習生！19歲痛失母親遵遺願追夢</p><p>罵粉絲惡心想揍人！Xdinary Heroes 隊長具建逸形象崩塌　JYP火速開鍘</p><p>【本文獲「聯合新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-14T09:02:34.716381+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":2013,"images":49,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}